139
00:09:16,611 --> 00:09:23,750
Scott: I mean this audio interface basically is like, you know, I don't need any kind of headset or anything now, right?

140
00:09:24,713 --> 00:09:25,618
Rym: I do use them separately.

141
00:09:25,658 --> 00:09:27,288
