Scott: That seems unlikely.

158
00:10:34,891 --> 00:10:40,586
Rym: Well, I bought like three gaming headsets in my life, and one of the older ones Emily's actually still using.

159
00:10:40,646 --> 00:10:41,408
Rym: Like, it's still fine.

160
00:10:41,428 --> 00:10:42,230
Rym: It's just really old.

161
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:44,989
Scott: What I found is that the, you know, I remember I had, what, the rig one?

162
00:10:45,310 --> 00:10:49,570
Rym: Yeah, the rig, like, actually really disappointed me in how un-durable it ended up being.

163
