Scott: Well, also, you know, before, that was like much earlier phone situations, like the ability to plug your phone into.

166
00:11:07,407 --> 00:11:08,710
Scott: it was kind of interesting.

167
00:11:08,930 --> 00:11:08,990
Rym: Yep.

168
